  partName: Exhaust Manifold Bolt (3)
  description: The Exhaust Manifold Bolt (3) is a tiny, elongated component made
    of Material.001, positioned at the bottom-left-front of the engine, playing a
    critical role in securing the exhaust manifold in place. Its small size and strategic
    location make it essential for maintaining exhaust system integrity and preventing
    leaks. Interestingly, the Exhaust Manifold Bolt (3) is designed with a coarse
    thread to ensure a secure connection.
